What this license does not cover

The MIT License above covers this project's own work. The parts below are
other people's work. Each keeps its own terms, and the MIT License grants no
rights in them.

- vendor/ holds mods and files by other authors. Each folder's README.md
  names the author, the terms the work is carried under and its source, and
  docs/formats/mods-and-vendor.md lists every folder. Some of these works are
  under an open license, and you may use them under its terms. For the
  others, nothing in this repository grants you a right to use them.

- These folders hold art from those mods, under the same terms as the mod:

    public/art/daggerfall-enemy-expansion/
    public/art/daggerfall-enemy-expansion-repainted/
    public/art/diverse-weapons/
    public/art/grimoire-ui/ (its fonts too)
    public/art/roleplay-realism/
    public/art/roleplay-realism-items/
    public/art/sands-of-the-alikr/
    public/art/snowfall/
    public/art/vanilla-enhanced/

- Code that ports a mod's behaviour names the mod in its comments. The mod
  author's rights in what was ported stay with the author.

- Fonts are under the SIL Open Font License, whose text sits beside them
  (app/launcher/fonts/, public/fonts/opendyslexic/, vendor/silkscreen-five/).

- public/sfx/SOURCES.md gives the source of each sound. A sound it credits to
  someone else keeps that source's terms.

