Daggerfall Unity

The game logic, data-layer readers and formulas in this port are translated
from Daggerfall Unity (https://github.com/Interkarma/daggerfall-unity), and
vendor/dfu-quests and vendor/dfu-books carry its quest scripts and book
table verbatim. Daggerfall Unity is licensed as follows:

